格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness ??:? Codex ?? fight-scene-director(??? AI ????????????)??? DSH ????,???? Seedance 2.0 / 2.5?MiniMax H3 ??????????","id":"gh:1369286754","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-fight-scene-director","slug":"hatsuyuki0103/dsh-fight-scene-director","topics":["ai-video","codex-port","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","minimax","prompt-engineering","seedance","skill","storyboard"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness ??:? Codex ?? fight-scene-director(??? AI ????????????)??? DSH ????,???? Seedance 2"},{"id":"p1s2","text":".0 / 2.5?MiniMax H3 ??????????"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-fight-scene-director"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Use the Codex skill **多画风打戏导演 / fight-scene-director** inside DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"It turns your characters, weapons, abilities, scene, references, story goal,\nduration, and trajector"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"y controls into an **executable AI-video fight prompt** —\naction causality and spatial movement firs"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"t, shots second. Output is structured\nChinese prompts aimed at **Seedance 2.0**, **Seedance 2.5**, a"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"utput is structured\nChinese prompts aimed at **Seedance 2.0**, **Seedance 2.5**, and **MiniMax H3**."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> Original skill by **AIZAO Aloong** —\n> ZzzAloong/fight-scene-director (MIT).\n> This repository is "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"the DeepSeek Harness port. See NOTICE and the\n> port report for exactly what changed."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- Designs a complete fight from a text brief, or revises an existing one.\n- Emits image prompts for "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"an initial-position map, a character-trajectory map,\nand a character-plus-camera dual-trajectory map"},{"id":"p7s3","text":".\n- Reads your supplied character / scene / initial-position / trajectory images\nand applies each by"},{"id":"p7s4","text":" its role.\n- Adapts action and camera work to melee, ranged, spell, group, summon, and\ntransformatio"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"n encounters.\n- Supports 15 s, 30 s, and custom durations, and appends an adjustable\nrhythm panel af"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"ter the copyable prompt.\n- Keeps characters, weapons, abilities, destruction, and spatial position\nc"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"ontinuous across cuts."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### Option A — straight from GitHub (recommended)"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"`dsh plugin add` forwards to `pnpm add`, and pnpm understands the\n`github:user/repo` spec — **no npm"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" account or published package is required.**\nAppend `#<tag>` to pin a revision for reproducibility:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Then restart the harness so the new profile layer is composed."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Option A2 — prebuilt tarball (no git, no build step)"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Every release attaches the packed artifact, which pnpm installs directly:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Use this when git-over-HTTPS is blocked on your network, or when you want a\nbyte-pinned artifact rat"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"over-HTTPS is blocked on your network, or when you want a\nbyte-pinned artifact rather than a branch."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Option B — from a local checkout"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Option C — manual link"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Add the checkout to your profile dependencies and bundle list yourself\n(`~/.dsh/profiles/web/package"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"checkout to your profile dependencies and bundle list yourself\n(`~/.dsh/profiles/web/package.json`):"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Verify the install"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"After restarting, confirm the plugin joined the profile's bundle layers — this\nis the check that act"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ually distinguishes \"installed\" from \"installed and\nmounted\":"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Step 2 must print the row with `id: dsh-fight-scene-director` and\n`name: dsh-fight-scene-director`. "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"A dependency without a composed row is\ninstalled but never mounted. (The skill provider's own intern"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"al name is\n`fsd-skills`; that appears in logger output, never as a patch row id.)"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Inside a session, ask for a fight scene in plain words — the skill is\nmodel-invocable, so `帮我设计一段 30"},{"id":"p27s2","text":" 秒的剑客对决打戏` is enough. To invoke it\nexplicitly, type the skill as its own word:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"If the skill does **not** appear:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"1. confirm the plugin landed as a *bundle layer* (step 2 above) — a dependency\nwithout `dsh.bundle` "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"is installed but never mounted;\n2. confirm you restarted the harness (profile bundles compose at boo"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"t);\n3. check `package.json` → `dsh.bundle.patch` resolves to `cordis.patch.yml`;\n4. look for `dsh-fi"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"ght-scene-director: skipped …` warnings in the harness log —\na skill file that fails the frontmatter"},{"id":"p30s5","text":" contract is skipped with a reason\nrather than silently dropped."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"### Adding or changing skills needs a restart"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"The skill registry caches the collected catalogue, and the provider can only ask\nfor a re-collection"},{"id":"p32s2","text":" from *inside* a call the registry has already made. So:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- **Editing or removing** the bundled skill while a session is live is picked up\nautomatically — the"},{"id":"p33s2","text":" next load notices the file changed, drops the stale entry,\nand asks the registry to re-collect.\n- *"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"*Adding a brand-new skill file** (including via `extraSkillDirs`) does **not**\nappear until you rest"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"art the harness. There is no filesystem watcher in this\nprovider; it reads the directory only when t"},{"id":"p33s5","text":"he registry asks it to."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Configure"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"The plugin accepts inline config in your profile's `cordis.patch.yml` / agent\npreset. The row id is "},{"id":"p35s2","text":"s inline config in your profile's `cordis.patch.yml` / agent\npreset. The row id is the package name:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Invalid values are rejected loudly rather than ignored: `maxSkills` must be an\ninteger `>= 1` (`0` w"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"ould silently empty the catalog), `extraSkillDirs` must be\nan array of non-empty strings, and `enabl"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"eSkills` must be a boolean. `null` or a\nmissing config means \"use defaults\"."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Uninstall"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"Then restart. Removing the dependency drops the bundle layer on the next boot;\nno files are written "},{"id":"p40s2","text":"outside the installed package."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"Two caveats worth knowing:"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"- **Do not mount this plugin more than once per profile.** Cordis loader entry\nids are global to the"},{"id":"p42s2","text":" composed tree, so a second row with the same id fails at\nboot. The id is the package name precisely"},{"id":"p42s3","text":" so that this is the only reachable\ncollision.\n- Installing from a local checkout (`link:`) then **m"},{"id":"p42s4","text":"oving or deleting that\ndirectory** leaves the profile unable to boot (`cannot resolve profile\nbundle"},{"id":"p42s5","text":"`). Remove the profile entry first, or install from GitHub instead.\n- `dsh plugin remove` removes th"},{"id":"p42s6","text":"e dependency and the bundle layer but can leave\nthe `node_modules` link behind; it is inert once the"},{"id":"p42s7","text":" bundle layer is gone."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## Repository layout"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"No dependencies to install — the tests use Node built-ins only. The suite\nenforces two things worth "},{"id":"p47s2","text":"s to install — the tests use Node built-ins only. The suite\nenforces two things worth knowing about:"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"- **`references/*.md` must stay byte-identical to the pinned upstream commit**\n(gate T3.4, hashes in"},{"id":"p48s2","text":" `test/fixtures/upstream-hashes.json`). Changing them on\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
